      "title": "Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures",
      "description": "Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures | Daemen University Skip to main content Apply Now Visit Give News MyDaemen A-Z Search Close Search Submit Admissions Academics Student Life About Alumni Athletics Menu Search Close Search Submit Admissions Academics Student Life About Alumni Athletics Apply Now Visit Give News MyDaemen A-Z 4380 Main Street, Amherst, NY 14226 800.462.7652 Admissions Academics Student Life About Alumni Athletics Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures Home About Fast Facts Leadership Campus Give to Daemen Facilities Centers and Initiatives Working at Daemen Policies and Procedures History Contact Us Working at Daemen Employment Opportunities New Employee Information & Procedures Hiring Supervisor Information & Procedures Employee Benefit and Contact Information Secure Upload Portal Employment Policies Supervisor/Employee Information & Forms Employee Safety & Injury Reporting Employee Training & Development Employee Wellness Resources Payroll Information Student Employment What Makes Buffalo Great New Employee Information & Procedures Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures Additional Navigation New Employee Information & Procedures Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures Cookie Notice We use Cookies on this site to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized ads or content, and analyze our traffic. By continuing to browse without changing your browser settings to block or delete Cookies, you agree to the storing of Cookies and related technologies on your device. Daemen University Privacy and Cookie Policy . Close Notice Listen Re-Hire Process for Staff and Faculty Any re-hires who haven't worked on Daemen's ADP WorkforceNow payroll in over a year (last pay check was over a year) will have to complete the re-hire paperwork and undergo a mandatory background check. This is best practice and keeps the University in compliance. Note: All re-new hires must complete an application to a posted position via ApplicantPro ( https://daemen.applicantpro.com/jobs/ ) before they can be onboarded. You will be emailed this direct job posting link from the Employment Coordinator. Please click the following tile if you are staff (hourly, salaried), or faculty (full time or adjunct) re-hire status: Staff Rehire Paperwork MORE All staff re-hires (part time or full time) employees need to complete al of the fillable documents and upload them to the Secure Form Portal . Once you upload your forms via the portal, please email the hr@daemen.edu to let us know the forms have all been submitted. Personnel Record Equal Opportunity Form State Taxes (NY) Federal Taxes Payment Option Form I-9 Employment Eligibility Form Required Document Form to Review & Acknowledge: Policy Acknowledgment Form All employees should review the Daemen University Policies and Procedures website: https://policies.daemen.edu/ Faculty/Adjunct Rehire Paperwork MORE All faculty/adjunct re-hires need to complete al of the fillable documents and upload them to the Secure Form Portal . Once you upload your forms via the portal, please email the hr@daemen.edu to let us know the forms have all been submitted. Personnel Record Equal Opportunity Form State Taxes (NY) Federal Taxes Payment Option Form I-9 Employment Eligibility Form Required Document Form to Review, Acknowledge & Submit via the portal: Policy Acknowledgment Form All employees should review the Daemen University Policies and Procedures website: https://policies.daemen.edu/ New Employee Information & Procedures Re-Hire Staff & Faculty Procedures Apply Request Info Visit A WORLD OF OPPORTUNITY 4380 Main Street, Amherst, NY 14226 +1 (800) 462-7652 Facebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn YouTube YouTube ZeeMee © 2026 Daemen University Privacy Statement Accessibility"
